ll open, no rush on your end.","subject":"Worth a Second Glance — Paid Collaboration | d''Alba","createdAt":"2026-08-11T09:38:19.208Z","inReplyTo":"<ddb2fc46-5ed7-8362-f7f7-c1b74269fe3f@dalbausa.com>","messageId":"<23493de6-c17c-2687-8273-5510e773a1bc@dalbausa.com>","senderName":"Anh Tuan","senderType":"USER"}]', false, false, 1786441099208, 186), ('conv-1785597153805-4yy5', 'ws-1785364956726', 'cr-scraped-1785372107269-fcp6', 'Lisa Fabrega', '@lisafabrega', 'https://kiieggrjhcidabifyhdu.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/avatars/cr-scraped-1785372107269-fcp6.webp', 'cmp-1785364956731', 'd''Alba', 'Need Reply', '2026-08-03T11:33:26.000Z', '[{"id":"msg-1785597153805-1hei","content":"","subject":"Creator Collaboration Opportunity | d''Alba Global","createdAt":"2026-08-01T15:12:25.821Z","messageId":"<c07fca77-ae5f-8d3d-25e4-0eb5ac9a2beb@dalbausa.com>","senderName":"Anh Tuan","senderType":"USER"},{"id":"msg-1785650915196-r8zs","content":"Thank you for reaching out!\\n\\nRest assured, I’ve received your email and your message is important to me.\\n\\nIf you’re a brand or agency and looking to speak with me about a social media\\ncollaboration, thank you for your kind words about my content and I''d love to\\ndiscuss collaborating.\\n\\nDue to the high volume of demand for my videos due to their conversion rates\\nbeing 3x higher, we are currently prioritizing paid collaborations and\\nretainers.\\n\\nPlease reply to this email for our current media kit, video and licensing rates.\\n\\nWorking with me means working with a brand partner, not just a video creator.\\n\\nWhen we collaborate you will get:\\n\\n* conversion-optimized content showcasing your product in a creative\\nand engaging way that aligns with your and my audience''s interests,\\n* 17 years of my experience in online marketing, sales and business strategy\\ninfused into your content to increase conversion and create\\n* long-term, income-producing video assets.\\n\\nTo give you a sense of the impact we can achieve together, I''ve generated over\\n$1 million GMV through my content in 2025 in less than 10 months, and have been\\nawarded GMV MVP by TikTok for being one of the top 1% earners on TikTok Shop.\\n\\nPlease note: we do not communicate via WhatsApp, only via this email.\\n\\nWe’re closed on weekends. So if you contacted us late Friday or the weekend we\\nwill reply on Monday, US time.\\n\\nLooking forward to collaborating!\\n\\nWarmly,\\nLisa Fábrega & Support Team","subject":"Thanks for Reaching Out Re: Creator Collaboration Opportunity | d''Alba Global","createdAt":"2026-08-01T15:12:23.000Z","messageId":"<CALnM_EbHuOY1bmap0-sq4ybdJiu2thepJnOGsakRt9rXf05xrQ@mail.gmail.com>","senderName":"Lisa Fabrega","senderType":"CREATOR"},{"id":"msg-1785841623996-j9je","content":"Hi Juan,\\n\\nThank you for reaching out!\\n\\nYou can find Lisa''s Creator Media Kit, performance statistics, and rates\\nHERE\\n\\nhttps://gamma.app/docs/Lisa-Fabrega-Creator-Media-Kit-Rates-902x8ciweekkxfx?mode=doc\\n.\\n\\nIf you''re interested in moving forward, we''d love to receive:\\n\\n- TikTok Shop product link(s)\\n- Standard commissi","subject":"Re: Creator Collaboration Opportunity | d''Alba Global","createdAt":"2026-08-03T11:33:26.000Z","inReplyTo":"<c07fca77-ae5f-8d3d-25e4-0eb5ac9a2beb@dalbausa.com>","messageId":"<CALnM_Ea-UpnhxHB85nLZibWrgGLDDpeu0uJxZORegq3oKAaCjA@mail.gmail.com>","senderName":"Lisa Fabrega","senderType":"CREATOR"}]', true, false, 1785756806000, 187), ('conv-1785852571572-8ahq', 'ws-1785364956726', 'cr-scraped-1785730963493-rf66', 'Ruby 🎀', '@rubyx.nails', 'https://kiieggrjhcidabifyhdu.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/avatars/cr-scraped-1785730963493-rf66.webp', 'cmp-1785364956731', 'd''Alba', 'Waiting Reply', '2026-08-04T14:09:16.215Z', '[{"id":"msg-1785852571572-4e0l","content":"","subject":"d''Alba x Creators — Paid Collaboration","createdAt":"2026-08-04T14:09:16.215Z","messageId":"<b0d0a938-b027-d2b2-fc06-cae609629825@dalbausa.com>","senderName":"Anh Tuan"